<title>USA: Moody's raises Albany, Ga., sewer bonds to Baa1.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Albany, Ga., sewer bonds to Baa1.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Jan 22 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 01/22/97.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Albany Sewer rev. (Underlying Rating)</p>
<p>    State		 : GA</p>
<p>    Rating		: Baa1</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 39,545,000</p>
<p>    Expected Sale Date: 01/22/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
